This workcell (bench, button housing, open place-box, materials, lighting)
is adapted from Text2MuJoCo showcase `01-button-cube-box`
(https://github.com/ShawnJoeng/Text2Mujoco). Geometry was reseated so the
bench top is at z = 0 and graspables were sized for the SO-101 jaw. No
Text2MuJoCo robot, weld, or actuator is included.

